{
  "abstract": "This specification updates RFC 5545 by introducing a number of new iCalendar properties and components that are of particular use for event publishers and in social networking. This specification also defines a new \"STRUCTURED-DATA\" property for iCalendar (RFC 5545) to allow for data that is directly pertinent to an event or task to be included with the calendar data.",
